        ]
      ],
      "error": "a drag stroke cannot be expressed",
      "documents": "pixeldesk's `drag` kind decomposes into a stroke, and this grammar has no MOVE primitive. It raises for the same reason a glide_to does, and for the same reason it must: the converters this replaces degraded exactly this into a stationary `+LMB -LMB`."
    }
